CREATE TABLE links (
  code        char(7) PRIMARY KEY,
  target_url  text NOT NULL,
  owner_id    uuid,
  created_at  timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),
  expires_at  timestamptz,
  is_active   boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT true
);
CREATE INDEX ON links (owner_id, created_at DESC);

GET /{code}
1. Look in Redis: GET link:{code}
2. Hit  → return 302/301 to target_url
3. Miss → query Postgres (replica), SET link:{code} value EX 3600
4. Record the click asynchronously (Kafka)
